==German==

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|de|rum|kümmeln}}. Probably variant of {{m|de|rumgammeln}}, associating it with {{m|de|Kümmel}} for comical reasons.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈʁʊmˌkʏməl(n)/}}
* {{rhymes|de|ʏməl|ʏməln|s=3}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb|rum.kümmeln}}

# to [[hang out]], in an especially sluggish manner; to [[loaf]]
#: {{syn|de|rumgammeln|abhängen|rumhängen|rumlungern|faulenzen}}

